      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:68ee8890d2c35022aaeafc15",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "到此为止获胜的精锐们的顶点决战，\\n群英月赛 DIRT决赛！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0955a265c37a34344dc07b3a1d1b0ecd2425bd97e290e5eccfd65c3f1bc8b728",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "9036"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d1bdcfa80393e0ac4acd1608",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "哪位赛马娘能够立于顶点！\\n群英月赛 DIRT决赛！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b052bb4a9e582e294e28e241ede8f2f94dcd90b39e07fc226f1b0950ff16d820",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "9037"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f0dd9affe30b42f97e6dfe4d",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "%h_rank_l1做到了！\\n群英月赛 DIRT决赛制胜，\\n精彩地夺得了桂冠！",
      "source_fingerprint": "043ac12849bf9181dfe3ee370017ffb7f5358cb0bc4ac53bb912eb94b6a76965",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "9038"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4cbc2fdd9ea3286d223d6d0a",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "胜者是%h_rank_ta1！\\n在这大舞台上取得了精彩的胜利，\\n赢得了沙土王者之宝座！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d5ecd6bbb1b62c77d86072cbd6d42da139289c37e38f53dfb4551ed0dd786fa9",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "9039"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6b00bc4ead80a65940f63080",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "%h_rank_a1%h_rank_to2\n展开了竞争！",
      "source_fingerprint": "12361c4c7e692110181abdfdb97abc6125f5f1ccd4292d9a0019e896b99d1d39",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "904"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:51b721e7384b531ec4a62afa",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "栄光已然在望！\\n群英月赛 CLASSIC决赛！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5763d08f955f0da7d41a49a9b037b739e3b07b71eb6e4c00b06cc6a2ed2d911a",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "9040"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2a32643b413b54b9c0655aa2",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "胜出的优骏们最后的大舞台！\\n群英月赛 CLASSIC决赛！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b9b95d5cfb0844b12f815bedebd8cdc8ef18eb19e17327090bc184c6fc2f43ef",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "9041"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dcae30dd0b48b4cf5c61c5ab",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "获胜的是%h_rank_ta1！\\n精彩地取得了群英月赛 CLASSIC\\n的桂冠！",
      "source_fingerprint": "6fd9865f4eea7c35be5c6a8bae735b3a08dff51931363310cfa72da8129b2e43",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "9042"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a9173049860513b97ed08584",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "获胜的是%h_rank_l1！\\n在中距离赛的王座决定战中制胜，\\n名垂青史！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a556d980f0a71743ed023d47c42e824f80b6abccdf87492c7a8f6f5ab75ccaab",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "9043"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b9f1437977f8959a5537fc2b",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "跨越众多赛场，所剩仅此一战！\\n群英月赛 LONG决赛！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5079110d79406c4a14756db9b542a48cd61435e3634edfda95dafd7ec0f53526",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "9044"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:70315f2e5d79404cf617086e",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "以顶点为目标，\\n拼搏至今的赛马娘们最后的舞台！\\n群英月赛 LONG决赛！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8c8ce6336714764ce2d771ebd80420f8d92987507bd284e139e2c3a8d3bcbe6b",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "9045"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:64f88707fe1514b2a0a18b7f",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "优胜者是%h_rank_l1！\\n精彩地制胜群英月赛 LONG，\\n立于优骏的顶点！",
      "source_fingerprint": "9aec59f3e794641b200d2c75ae41b32ffab2423ed45ef5189e0e4da732dc5d56",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "9046"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2c2a2fc71d3a71ca5208ffcf",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "优胜者是%h_rank_l1！\\n她以与顶点相符的奔跑，\\n在长途马娘们的激战中制胜！",
      "source_fingerprint": "53b198aae3aea556dc7efbb7aa77c101b793e12e2e4694fa7cb92c850c69b0c6",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "9047"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4ac773c3dd0e27bdb71f1d72",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "决定优骏中的最强者的比赛，\\n群英月赛 SPRINT决赛！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7cd85f55d1083f325ff786859d944c7689115c0e8f197ee45e5b7d8935f6167c",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "9048"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c33088ce9626a94fefe12893",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "在这大舞台中脱颖而出，夺得荣冠的赛马娘会是谁！\\n群英月赛 SPRINT决赛！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e1a62eb5b9074aa0234ff1d05c317afb276fff038e5f255874c1794ef11b9b38",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "9049"
      ]
    },
