      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:df4aa0487a8d8ae3fc9e8dfd",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "引以为傲的快足赛马娘们齐聚一堂\\nDream Fest Pride！\\n英里王者的称号将花落谁家！",
