    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d868505d7d59706b54a6dcac",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "以英里赛顶峰为目标，名将云集！\\nDream Fest Legend！\\n究竟哪位赛马娘能抵达顶点！",
